  "description": "X.Org X11 libXfont2 runtime library  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * libXfont2: BitmapScaleBitmaps Integer Overflow Heap Buffer Overflow (CVE-2026-56001)\n  * libXfont2: PCF Font Parsing Heap Buffer Overflow (CVE-2026-56002)\n  * libXfont2: computeProps Property Buffer Heap Buffer Overflow (CVE-2026-56003)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
